## Core Tables

| Table | Primary Key | Key Relationships |
|-------|-------------|-------------------|
| `profiles` | `id` (UUID) | → `auth.users` (1:1), → `umkm_profiles` (1:0/1) |
| `umkm_profiles` | `id` | → `profiles.user_id` (1:1), → `products` (1:N) |
| `products` | `id` | → `umkm_profiles.umkm_id` (N:1), → `orders` (1:N) |
| `orders` | `id` | → `profiles.buyer_id` (N:1), → `umkm_profiles.umkm_id` (N:1), → `products.product_id` (N:1) |
| `subscriptions` | `id` | → `umkm_profiles.umkm_id` (N:1), → `plans.plan_id` (N:1) |
| `addresses` | `id` | → `profiles.user_id` (N:1) |
| `shipments` | `id` | → `orders.order_code` (1:1), → `courier_assignments` (1:N) |

---

## Key Columns

### `profiles`

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `id` | UUID | PK, FK to auth.users |
| `email` | TEXT | From auth |
| `full_name` | TEXT | Display name |
| `role` | user_role | `buyer` \| `umkm` \| `admin` |
| `phone` | TEXT | Contact |
| `avatar_url` | TEXT | Supabase Storage path |
| `is_verified` | BOOLEAN | Email verified |
| `account_status` | account_status | `active` \| `suspended` \| `banned` |

### `umkm_profiles`

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `id` | UUID | PK |
| `user_id` | UUID | FK to profiles |
| `business_name` | TEXT | Store name |
| `slug` | TEXT | URL-friendly |
| `city` | TEXT | City (Depok) |
| `latitude`/`longitude` | NUMERIC | Store location |
| `is_verified` | BOOLEAN | Admin approved |
| `rating` | NUMERIC | Avg rating |

### `products`

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `id` | UUID | PK |
| `umkm_id` | UUID | FK to umkm_profiles |
| `name` | TEXT | Product name |
| `category` | TEXT | Category |
| `surplus_price` | INTEGER | Sale price (IDR minor) |
| `original_price` | INTEGER | Strike-through price |
| `stock` | INTEGER | Available qty |
| `status` | product_status | `available` \| `sold_out` \| `hidden` |
| `verification_status` | TEXT | `pending` \| `approved` \| `rejected` |
| `image_url` | TEXT | Supabase Storage path |
| `flash_sale_price` | INTEGER | Promo price |
| `flash_sale_start`/`end` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Schedule |
| `is_delivery`/`is_pickup` | BOOLEAN | Fulfillment options |

### `orders`

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `id` | UUID | PK |
| `order_code` | TEXT | Human-readable: `RB-YYYYMMDD-XXXXX` |
| `buyer_id` | UUID | FK to profiles |
| `umkm_id` | UUID | FK to umkm_profiles |
| `product_id` | UUID | FK to products |
| `quantity` | INTEGER | Qty ordered |
| `total_price` | INTEGER | Final price (IDR minor) |
| `delivery_option` | delivery_option | `delivery` \| `pickup` |
| `payment_status` | payment_status | `unpaid` \| `paid` \| `failed` \| `refunded` |
| `order_status` | order_status | `pending`...`completed` |
| `invoice_state` | TEXT | `pending` \| `paid` \| `failed` \| `refunded` |
| `address_snapshot` | JSONB | Frozen address at order time |
| `coin_used`/`coin_earned` | INTEGER | Loyalty |
| `co2e_saved_kg` | NUMERIC | Environmental impact |

