## RLS Policy Summary

| Table | Policies |
|-------|----------|
| `profiles` | Self read/write, Admin all |
| `umkm_profiles` | Public read, Owner write, Admin all |
| `products` | Approved public read, Seller all, Admin all |
| `orders` | Buyer own, Seller own UMKM, Admin all |
| `addresses` | Self, Admin |
| `subscriptions` | Seller own, Admin all |
| `shipments` | Buyer/Seller own order, Admin all |
| `courier_profiles` | Self, Admin |
| `courier_assignments` | Courier own, Admin all |
| `chat_messages` | Participants, Admin |
| `notifications` | Self only |

